      "body": "[codex/claude generated]\n\n## Motivation\n\nThe NVIDIA megakernel commit pin is duplicated in the two CUDA Dockerfiles. Move it to a dedicated file so version updates have one source of truth and future CI can detect pin changes using a file path filter.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Add `docker/sgl-nvidia-mega.commit`, preserving the existing pinned revision `54b428921749fef89fcbd043000f839ac9cc4638`.\n- Read the shared file through a BuildKit bind mount in both Dockerfiles.\n- Preserve `--build-arg SGL_NVIDIA_MEGA_COMMIT=...` overrides and the existing installation skip conditions.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- All applicable pre-commit hooks passed.\n- Shell syntax checks and 10 mocked shell scenarios passed across both Dockerfiles: default pin, explicit override, disabled installation, unsupported CUDA, and missing pin file.\n- Full Docker builds were not run locally; these shell checks do not validate image construction.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable: the dependency revision and runtime code are unchanged.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n- Unit tests, documentation updates, and accuracy/speed benchmarks: not applicable to this pin-location refactor; local shell validation is described above.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #41568482133](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41568482133)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41568482070](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41568482070)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests 